# Cursor bridge branch lock

Pandamonium **cursor-bridge work stays on `cursor-bridge`**. Do not switch to `main` until bridge work is merged or explicitly abandoned.

## Branch rules

- Active branch: **`cursor-bridge`**
- `main` must **not** receive bridge-only files (`cursorBridge.js`, `cursor_bridge_routes.py`, `services/cursor-bridge/`, `services/pc-cursor-bridge/`, etc.).
- Before any merge to `main`, verify with `git diff main...cursor-bridge --stat` and drop bridge-only paths from the merge.

## Verify before coding

```bash
cd /mnt/dev-env/projects/pandamonium
git branch --show-current   # must print: cursor-bridge
```

If the IDE status bar shows `main`, run `git checkout cursor-bridge` on the SSH host and reload the window.

## Deploy

Panda Docker image is built from the **checked-out branch**. After bridge changes:

```bash
sudo systemctl restart pandamonium.service
```

(or `docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker/host-proxmox.yml up -d --build`)
